{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷被圍"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「便雅憫人啊，你們要逃離耶路撒冷！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要在提哥亞吹響號角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在伯·哈基琳發出警報，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為有大災難從北方逼近。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毀滅美麗嬌弱的少女錫安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領必帶著軍隊圍攻她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在她周圍安營紮寨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同牧人在各自的片區放牧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們喊道，『準備作戰！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來吧，我們中午攻城。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們後來說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『唉！日已西沉，天色漸暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來吧，我們要乘夜攻打她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅她的宮殿。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要砍伐樹木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修築高臺圍攻耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這城充滿壓迫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"該受懲罰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的邪惡如同泉水湧流不息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴力和毀滅之聲充斥城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見的盡是疾病和傷痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你要接受告誡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否則我要離棄你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你荒無人煙。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["叛逆的以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「敵人要把以色列的餘民擄掠一空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同人摘葡萄摘得一個不剩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要像摘葡萄的人一樣伸手再摘枝上的葡萄。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可以警告誰呢？誰會聽呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們耳朵閉塞，什麼也聽不見！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和華的話他們聽著逆耳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不喜歡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我充滿耶和華的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無法忍而不發。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「你把我的怒氣發向街頭的孩童和聚集成群的青年。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丈夫和妻子、老人和長者都要一同被擄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的房屋、田地和妻子都要交給別人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要伸手攻擊這地方的居民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們無論尊卑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"個個貪圖不義之財；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無論是先知還是祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都行為詭詐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們敷衍了事地醫治我子民的傷痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說，『沒事了，沒事了！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實情況很糟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們做可憎的事會羞愧嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不！他們不知廉恥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不臉紅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們要與滅亡的人一同滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要在我懲罰之時覆滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要站在路口觀看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋訪古道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找到正路並行在其上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便會得到心靈的安寧。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們卻說：「我們不要這樣行。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我為你們設立守望者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提醒你們要聽號角聲。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們卻說：「我們不聽。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「列國啊，你們要聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"會眾啊，要知道這些百姓的遭遇！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地啊，聽著！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要降災禍給這些百姓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是自作自受，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們沒有聽從我的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拒絕遵守我的律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從示巴運來乳香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遠方帶來菖蒲獻給我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有什麼用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不悅納他們的燔祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不喜歡他們的祭牲。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要把絆腳石放在他們前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使父子一同絆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鄰居和朋友一同滅亡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，有一個民族要從北方來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一個強國要從地極發動進攻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女錫安啊，他們殘酷無情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手持弓箭和矛槍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騎馬奔來，聲勢如怒海狂濤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列陣攻擊你。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們聽到風聲，四肢發軟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如分娩的婦人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要去田野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在路上走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為仇敵殺氣騰騰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怖四下瀰漫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，你們要身披麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在灰中打滾；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要悲傷痛哭，如喪獨子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為毀滅者將突然臨到我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我派你考驗我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像冶煉金屬一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好察驗他們的行為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們頑固不化，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如銅如鐵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四處譭謗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"極其敗壞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"風箱猛力吹火，鉛也會熔掉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們被煉了又煉，終是徒然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為邪惡之人仍未被清除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們被稱為廢棄的銀渣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華已丟棄他們。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}